{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"result":{"contents":{"kind":"markdown","value":"```zerolang\nintliteral: record\n```\n\nthe type an integer literal has before context pins it. Compile-time only:\n`create: null`, so a binding that names it bare is refused like any other\nnon-constructible type, and it never reaches emission.\n\nfalls to `i64` here"}}}
